accTitle: Review choice lifecycle
accDescr: Editing creates a draft. Returning feedback records a response. A material revision requires another review.
[*] --> Unreviewed
Unreviewed --> Draft: choose or comment
Draft --> Returned: return feedback
Returned --> NeedsReview: material change
NeedsReview --> Draft: review again
Returned --> [*]: decision recorded

